{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and manage your dream caf\u00e9!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cafe Business Manager isn\u2019t just a business simulation \u2014 it\u2019s a deep life experience. Start from scratch in the heart of the island, hire your staff, train them, and set fair salaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your caf\u00e9 unique with your decoration choices, shape your menu based on your customers\u2019 preferences, and grow your business through smart daily decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each happy customer, wise investment, and good employee relationship brings you closer to becoming the island\u2019s top caf\u00e9 owner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/92105fc9d60dabd1b6fd999212a5d337.webp?t=1773255152\" width=512 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover your employees\u2019 skills and help them grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their motivation changes based on salary, work hours, and workload \u2014 assign tasks wisely and plan your team strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign single or multiple roles: take orders, serve, clean tables, wash dishes, or organize the counter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage effectively to maximize your caf\u00e9\u2019s efficiency.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/2ed3394cfab1afc931676b5bf0c5a52c.poster.avif?t=1773255152\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/2ed3394cfab1afc931676b5bf0c5a52c.webm?t=1773255152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/ddea0b5e23d9189d0ed1dc2941249e64.webp?t=1773255152\" width=512 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your caf\u00e9 from scratch and fully customize it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from tables, chairs, coffee machines, ovens, and decorative items to create a unique space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add new floors, build a terrace, and expand your land to craft your dream caf\u00e9.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your style in every detail and impress your customers!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/5c0c0614bcefecf5df133dfb6b5ab653.poster.avif?t=1773255152\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/5c0c0614bcefecf5df133dfb6b5ab653.webm?t=1773255152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/36cd34b8c5dea4d971ef1c7d04f4f6ea.webp?t=1773255152\" width=512 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island freely and quickly restock your caf\u00e9\u2019s needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use express drone deliveries or drive your pickup to shop personally, stock shelves, and assign staff to handle supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shopping trip brings deals and surprises \u2014 plan strategically and strengthen your caf\u00e9!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/c869c53ab0a5bc28803d71895dfeacee.poster.avif?t=1773255152\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/c869c53ab0a5bc28803d71895dfeacee.webm?t=1773255152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/d2f1b1ebb11c11b6ad976892d6a45d2e.webp?t=1773255152\" width=512 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create time-based menus and make sure orders are taken quickly and accurately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize food quality, temperature, and service time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offer both takeaway and table service experiences.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/99088e9102c002eb7da081e55350d09f.poster.avif?t=1773255152\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/99088e9102c002eb7da081e55350d09f.webm?t=1773255152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/909547d2dc8a390b8190e9a6801c3d3c.webp?t=1773255152\" width=512 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle sudden rushes of customers efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take loans, set repayment terms, manage interest rates, and develop your own financial strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a storage room, organize boxes on shelves, and access needed items instantly to speed up operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026480?t=1773255152","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026480?t=1773255152","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/97bef9a0a24061f81a376aa8a8406833898bdd09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773255152","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/97bef9a0a24061f81a376aa8a8406833898bdd09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773255152","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4184780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/d7910ac03f848ba0231b0693bf0b3978.avif?t=1773255152\" width=1560 height=718 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and manage your dream caf\u00e9!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cafe Business Manager isn\u2019t just a business simulation \u2014 it\u2019s a deep life experience. Start from scratch in the heart of the island, hire your staff, train them, and set fair salaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your caf\u00e9 unique with your decoration choices, shape your menu based on your customers\u2019 preferences, and grow your business through smart daily decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each happy customer, wise investment, and good employee relationship brings you closer to becoming the island\u2019s top caf\u00e9 owner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/92105fc9d60dabd1b6fd999212a5d337.webp?t=1773255152\" width=512 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover your employees\u2019 skills and help them grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their motivation changes based on salary, work hours, and workload \u2014 assign tasks wisely and plan your team strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign single or multiple roles: take orders, serve, clean tables, wash dishes, or organize the counter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage effectively to maximize your caf\u00e9\u2019s efficiency.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/2ed3394cfab1afc931676b5bf0c5a52c.poster.avif?t=1773255152\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/2ed3394cfab1afc931676b5bf0c5a52c.webm?t=1773255152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/ddea0b5e23d9189d0ed1dc2941249e64.webp?t=1773255152\" width=512 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your caf\u00e9 from scratch and fully customize it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from tables, chairs, coffee machines, ovens, and decorative items to create a unique space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add new floors, build a terrace, and expand your land to craft your dream caf\u00e9.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your style in every detail and impress your customers!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vi