=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize food quality, temperature, and service time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offer both takeaway and table service experiences.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/99088e9102c002eb7da081e55350d09f.poster.avif?t=1773255152\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/99088e9102c002eb7da081e55350d09f.webm?t=1773255152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/extras/909547d2dc8a390b8190e9a6801c3d3c.webp?t=1773255152\" width=512 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle sudden rushes of customers efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take loans, set repayment terms, manage interest rates, and develop your own financial strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a storage room, organize boxes on shelves, and access needed items instantly to speed up operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Caos Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026480/b6fd4714ad8c0abfaca17fb1ab1cc6cb683a2b48/header.jpg?t=1773255152","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"b